			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 790231101,
					"content": "一定得找到那個徽記…一定得找到那個徽記才行啊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790231102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "葉夫卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 790231102,
					"content": "（找到徽記再和他搭話吧…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": []
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7902312,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7902313
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_AUTO",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7902313",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7902313,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"葉夫卡"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 790231201,
					"content": "這個…對，就是這個，這上面的劃痕我記得一清二楚…嗯，這裡怎麼多了個缺口…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790231202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "葉夫卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 790231202,
					"content": "對了，那時候雅科夫把這個徽記往下扔…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790231203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "葉夫卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 790231203,
					"content": "是嗎，難怪這個徽記在那麼奇怪的地方…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790231204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 790231204,
					"content": "#原來是這樣，哈哈哈，沒想到在海邊，終於找到了…真是謝謝{F#妳}{M#你}們啊，這世上這麼好心的人可不多了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790231205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "葉夫卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 790231205,
					"content": "#不對，{F#妳}{M#你}們是…{F#妳}{M#你}們是{NICKNAME}和派蒙！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790231206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "葉夫卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 790231206,
					"content": "#對，我就是{NICKNAME}！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790231207
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 790231207,
					"content": "對，我就是派蒙！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790231208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 790231208,
					"content": "#我明白了…既然落到了{F#妳}{M#你}們的手裡，那也沒有什麼辦法了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790231209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "葉夫卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 790231209,
					"content": "我的父親曾這樣教導我，「如若落在敵手受辱，還不如慷慨就義，為家族贏得榮譽」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790231210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "葉夫卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 790231210,
					"content": "嗚哇，聽起來有點可怕…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790231211,
						790231212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 790231211,
					"content": "居然說這樣的話…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790231213
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 790231213,
					"content": "不過我們只是好奇你出現在這裡的目的而已啦…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790231214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 790231214,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790231215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "葉夫卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 790231215,
					"content": "我的父親曾這樣教導我，「向敵人說出情報，那就和背叛沒什麼兩樣，我們家族沒有為了苟活而背叛的人！」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790231216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "葉夫卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 790231216,
					"content": "嚴厲過頭了吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790231217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 790231217,
					"content": "嚴厲過頭了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790231218
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 790231218,
					"content": "#所以按照父親的教導，不僅落在{F#妳}{M#你}們手上，還接受了{F#妳}{M#你}們的幫助，實在是讓人感到羞愧的一件事…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790231219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "葉夫卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 790231219,
					"content": "實不相瞞，我現在，羞愧得想要大哭一場！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790231220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "葉夫卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 790231220,
					"content": "知道了，這又不是什麼值得自豪的事，沒必要說那麼大聲啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790231221
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 790231221,
					"content": "但是父親也曾這樣教導我，「受人恩惠，就該好好回報。」父親的教導，在現在的情況裡，產生了矛盾。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790231222
					],
					"speakerTitle": "葉夫卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 790231222,
					"content": "所以我決定…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790231223
					],
					"speakerTitle": "葉夫卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 790231223,
					"content": "你決定？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790231224
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 790231224,
					"content": "#就按照我的意思來吧，我會告訴{F#妳}{M#你}們的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790231225
					],
					"speakerTitle": "葉夫卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 790231225,
					"content": "突然就變得隨意了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790231226
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 790231226,
					"content": "我的名字是葉夫卡，原本是在做裝置信號的測試工作…唔，這段記憶有點不清楚，總之，我記得我們一路來到這座島…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790231227
					],
					"speakerTitle": "葉夫卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 790231227,
					"content": "哦，對了，雅科夫，我是和雅科夫一起行動的，這之間還和他大吵了一架，導致他扔掉了這枚徽記…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790231228
					],
					"speakerTitle": "葉夫卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 790231228,
					"content": "後來我…眼睜睜地看著雅科夫走進一個奇怪的東西裡，然後他就和那個東西一起消失了。我不會從此以後都見不到他了吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790231229
					],
					"speakerTitle": "葉夫卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 790231229,
					"content": "所以我才在這裡，找能重新見到他的方法…然後不知道為什麼腦袋「嗡」了一下，就變成了剛才那樣。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790231230
					],
					"speakerTitle": "葉夫卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 790231230,
					"content": "走進去就會消失的奇怪的東西…是什麼金蘋果群島的怪談嗎…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790231231,
						790231232
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 790231231,
					"content": "是恐怖的扭曲陷阱！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790231233
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 790231233,
					"content": "應該不是那樣的東西吧…說不定其實就跟我們以前見過的那些奇怪的機關道路一樣…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790231234
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 790231234,
					"content": "說不定確實有重新打開的辦法呢！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790231235
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 790231235,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}們、{F#妳}{M#你}們能打開那個嗎…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790231236
					],
					"speakerTitle": "葉夫卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 790231236,
					"content": "可以是可以啦，不過我們為什麼要幫你呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790231237
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 790231237,
					"content": "明明是愚人眾呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790231238
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 790231238,
					"content": "#如果{F#妳}{M#你}們能打開，找到雅科夫，{F#妳}{M#你}們要我說什麼我都會說的…啊，執行官大人們的壞話除外。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790231239
					],
					"speakerTitle": "葉夫卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 790231239,
					"content": "哇，答應得好快，弄得我都覺得自己是反派了…而且，這個時候就遺忘你父親的教導了嗎…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790231240
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 790231240,
					"content": "本來就是因為我的過錯所以雅科夫才…有些事情，是比所謂的原則和教導更重要的…我是這麼認為的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790231241
					],
					"speakerTitle": "葉夫卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 790231241,
					"content": "#好吧！{NICKNAME}，我們就試試看看吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 790231232,
					"content": "是無形的吃人魔物！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790231233
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 790231212,
					"content": "不是合格的父親會說的話！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790231213
					]
				}
			]
		},
